...@../../../dev/d2/themes/flow
# Core design only; source identities and proof receipts remain in Org.
title: WEAVER / INDEPENDENT ADMISSION / QUALIFIED RECOVERY {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
protocols: GO / RECOVERY CONTROL {
  top: 0
  left: 0
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  mcp: Resolve the original operation\nHistorical success remains historical\nUnknown result retains pending intent {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  a2a: Query the current recovery head\nNamespace / prefix / owner binding\nOld result is no activation permit {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  acp: Cloud native worker recovery\nPreserve original operation identity\nNo empty authority on restart {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  goBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/go.svg
    top: 247
    left: 24
    width: 42
    height: 22
  }
  kubernetesBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/kubernetes.svg
    top: 247
    left: 82
    width: 28
    height: 28
  }
}
registry: SCHEME / ORIGINAL INTENT {
  top: 0
  left: 440
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  origin: Original claim and profile binding\nExact intent and source lineage\nOriginal reservation and budget domain {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  alias: Cedar Code as Policy\nCurrent context and takeover role\nReauthorize the same original intent {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  query: Pending work retains its hold\nControl records apply no money\nLate financial commit stays separate {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
recovery: RUST / INDEPENDENT PUBLICATION {
  top: 0
  left: 880
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  projection: Prepare the exact recovery image\nRoot / closed tail / live generation\nOriginal cut and pending candidate {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  join: Retain every determining body\nIndependent archive and lineage\nDigest alone is no recoverable copy {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  fence: Commit one determining prefix\nOriginal key / parent / current owner\nNo financial effect or provider send {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
}
broker: RUST / CONFIRM AND RECOVER {
  top: 0
  left: 1320
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  cas: Authenticate the current head\nExact record and governing context\nRecheck at the actual final CAS {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  alias: Rebuild exact admission metadata\nVerify every required body\nLocal restore grants no authority {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  hold: Join current source and account gates\nOld worker or missing tail stays closed\nOriginal unknown hold remains bound {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  rustBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
    top: 40
    left: 156
    width: 34
    height: 34
  }
}
quint: QUINT\nLost commit / old result / inconsistent snapshots\nMissing tail / stale worker / conflicting original key {
  top: 810
  left: 220
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: policy
}
lean: LEAN\nActual handoff / account / source composition\nCommitted prefix / current floor / original unknown holds {
  top: 810
  left: 960
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: semantic
}
protocols.mcp -> registry.origin
protocols.a2a -> registry.alias
protocols.acp -> registry.query
registry.origin -> recovery.projection
registry.alias -> recovery.join
registry.query -> recovery.fence { style.stroke-dash: 4 }
recovery.projection -> recovery.join
recovery.join -> recovery.fence
recovery.fence -> broker.cas
broker.cas -> broker.alias
broker.alias -> broker.hold
broker.hold -> broker.cas: Refresh current head { style.stroke-dash: 4 }

